{
    "Role_DateColumn": "Date Column",
    "Role_GranColumn": "Granularity Column (optional)",
    "Role_GranColumn_Desc": "Physical column with granularity codes (D/W/M/Q/S/Y), e.g. AUX_PERIOD[Aux_Period]. Can be an ordinary small disconnected table — no cartesian join or special shaping needed. When bound, granularity becomes part of the same real, cross-page-synced filter as the date range. When left unbound, the selector still works fully; granularity is just UI-only (no filter sent for it specifically).",
